WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A witness sees a face. Then comes a reasonable question: Can you describe it?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In some laboratory studies, describing a face made a later lineup identification harder.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The large replications found a timing-sensitive effect, not one universal number.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
An explanation can sound clear and still require its own evidence.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 sells twelve-minute meditation audio. Those studies did not test Zen12.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the free evidence guide. Buy only when the actual terms and proof suit you.
